# Voice / Polish UX

- Spoken replies stay short (prefer first sentence). No tool dumps or long English explanations via TTS.
- Barge-in / `stop_speaking` must not take down the process; log crashes to `runtime_crash_*.json` via crash helpers.
- Preserve semantic user text through preprocessing; do not drop app/artist/query slots while normalizing.
- Acoustic wake preferred; legacy STT wake is fallback only — do not “fix” by removing wake policy without a phase.
- Session idle / end phrases clear pending interactions cleanly.
